# Generated résumé PDFs at repo root (the application archive is kept, see below)
/*.pdf

# Keep the application archive
!archive/bewerbungen/
!archive/bewerbungen/*.pdf
# ...but never the dev filesystem store's JSON files (DATA_DIR defaults here)
archive/bewerbungen/*.json

# Vite build output (recruiting kit)
design/myjob/ui_kits/recruiting/dist/

# Capacitor native platform projects (generated by `cap add` on a dev machine
